
  
 Abstract for session 
"Computational Commutative Algebra"

Session Organizers:

 Alkiviadis Akritas,
 Gennadi Malaschonok


 The topics to be covered in this session are:

 - Constructive methods in Commutative Algebra
 - Effective methods and complexity issues in commutative algebra
 (Computation of Gboebner basis, computation of GCD, PRS, determinant,
 characteristic polynomials, solution of equations, and system of equations
 etc.)
 - Theory and practice of computation
 (application of this method in the Computer Algebra Systems)

